/-!
# Actual holomorphic coefficient maps for open embeddings

Literal composition on every actual open defines a complex-algebra
pullback and a morphism of the original holomorphic function sheaves.
The coefficient maps satisfy composition and identity through the
canonical comparisons of the actual restriction functors. For original
open inclusions they are the existing holomorphic restriction isomorphisms,
and these satisfy the actual nested-open coefficient square.

The construction uses only open embedding and forward holomorphicity in
the given atlases. No inverse holomorphicity, manifold regularity, separation,
or finite-dimensional hypothesis is required. This file asserts no
cohomology comparison or vanishing result.
-/
